message: "If you use this research software, please cite the thesis below."
title: "Graph-Based Planning for Germany's EV Charging Network"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Filomeno
    given-names: Giovanni
repository-code: "https://github.com/GiovanniFilomeno/Optimization-Charging-Station-Network-MscThesis"
