license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research software accompanying a 2023 Master's thesis on representing
  Germany's public electric-vehicle charging infrastructure as cumulative
  spatial graphs and exploring alternative station placements through
  coordinate prediction and evolutionary optimization.
keywords:
  - electric vehicle charging
  - infrastructure planning
  - graph theory
  - genetic algorithm
  - geospatial analysis
  - Germany
